            "description_html": "<b>Weslock Hudson Knob</B><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<P><B> Knob Features and Benefits</B><UL>\r\n<LI>5-pin Cylinder with special keying capabilities</LI>\r\n<LI>Tubular design meeting Grade 3 lock standards</LI>\r\n<LI>Turn button locking in knob</LI>\r\n<LI>Non-concealed installation screws</LI></UL></P>\r\n<P><B>Specifications</B><UL>\r\n<LI>Adjustable Latches 2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\" with fixed radius faceplate </LI>\r\n<LI>Fits doors prepared with 2 1/8\" cross hole and 1\" edge hole</LI>\r\n<LI>Adjusts to door thinkness from 1 3/8\" to 2\" </LI></UL></P>\r\n<P><B>Warranty</B><UL>\r\n<LI>Limited 10 year Mechanical Warranty</LI>\r\n<LI>Limited 3 year Finish Warranty</LI>\r\n<BR>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing a function:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry: Use when a keyed lock is needed.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<BR>\r\n<br><BR>\r\nClick below to choose finish and knob function.</B>\r\n<br>",
